    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "The Gu is already extinct as a rank five mortal Gu, and the recipe sells for two immortal essence stones. Fang Yuan buys that ancient recipe together with the poison breath killer move. The rarest refinement material is stone monkey fur; Fairy Li Shan sells him the recipe because that material has reappeared on the market.",
        "chapters": [
          679
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "recipe-and-materials",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_mortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Its ability is to converge the strength of a group into one. Matched with the killer move myriad self, it greatly raises Fang Yuan’s strength. He buys five hundred stone monkey fur, divides the recipe with old hairy men, and after three days and nights obtains forty-five rank five group strength Gu, then merges them into myriad self.",
        "chapters": [
          682
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect-and-refinement",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When those forty-five Gu activate inside myriad self, hundreds of strength path phantoms disperse and their strength gathers into Fang Yuan.",
        "chapters": [
          685
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect-and-refinement",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
